  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c5f532fb-8d24-4ade-80cc-7f2b6c4f7d42.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"163\"></strong></p><p><strong>LevelUP</strong> 是一個輕量級的進度框架，新增了一套全域等級與經驗值系統，專為跨多個模組使用而設計。它是 Mythcraft 生態系統的核心基礎，為模組提供一致的難度調整、功能解鎖與玩家進度獎勵機制。</p><hr><h3>核心功能</h3><p><strong>全域玩家等級</strong></p><p>- 獨立於原版經驗值的自訂等級系統</p><p>- 可透過可設定的進度曲線進行調整</p><p>- 設計可讓多個模組同時使用</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>物品欄等級顯示</strong></p><p>- 整合至物品欄介面的簡潔等級顯示</p><p>- 一覽當前等級</p><hr><h3>專為模組整合打造</h3><p>LevelUP 被設計為 <strong>函式庫 + 框架</strong>，而非單純的獨立模組。</p><p>其他模組可以：</p><p>- 讀取玩家等級與經驗值</p><p>- 生成 LevelUP 經驗球</p><p>- 對升級事件做出反應</p><p>- 根據玩家進度調整遊戲機制</p><hr><h3>開發者專區</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://github.com/Revilo-Dev/LevelUP/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1489244/description_5901c24c-f1d5-41db-a3ca-5939cb10266b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"85\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252frevilodev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_0319d947-d5a9-45be-8b1c-4a7f1bce42dc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"267\" height=\"85\"></a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/revilodev/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_901f915d-57c8-4d87-8269-aea435c85b48.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13)\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://github.com/Revilo-Dev/LevelUP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_2fbe8561-3d3a-4ea7-a342-6fe515869f42.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DARzByw6VW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_323e6baf-a51e-489c-9877-5dad505ab153.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13)\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frevilodev.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_5131ac43-34b5-447c-a0a6-53d74d145f87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"269\" height=\"85\"></a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
